{"id":10,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls."},{"games":["Sword","Gold"],"text":"For protection, it releases a horrible stench from the antenna on its head to drive away enemies."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"If you touch the feeler on top of its head, it will release a horrible stink to protect itself."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its body is soft and weak. In nature, its perpetual fate is to be seen by others as food."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Perhaps because it would like to grow up quickly, it has a voracious appetite, eating a hundred leaves a day."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It’s easy to catch, and it grows quickly, making it one of the top recommendations for novice Pokémon Trainers."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"When attacked by bird Pokémon, it resists by releasing a terrifically strong odor from its antennae, but it often becomes their prey."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Caterpie has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this Pokémon releases a terrifically strong odor."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Its feet have suction cups designed to stick to any surface. It tenaciously climbs trees to forage."},{"games":["X","HeartGold"],"text":"For protection, it releases a horrible stench from the antennae on its head to drive away enemies."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"It is covered with a green skin. When it grows, it sheds the skin, covers itself with silk, and becomes a cocoon."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its voracious appetite compels it to devour leaves bigger than itself without hesitation. It releases a terribly strong odor from its antennae."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It crawls into foliage where it camouflages itself among leaves that are the same color as its body."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Shield Dust","hidden":false,"description":"Protective dust shields the Pokémon from the additional effects of moves."},{"name":"Run Away","hidden":true,"description":"Enables a sure getaway from wild Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"forest","color":"Green","shape":"Armor","evolution":{"id":10,"name":"Caterpie","condition":null,"children":[{"id":11,"name":"Metapod","condition":"Lv. 7","children":[{"id":12,"name":"Butterfree","condition":"Lv. 10","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,33],[1,81],[9,450]],"machine":[527],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv3pt5-172","name":"Caterpie","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"172","artist":"Teeziro","img":"sv3pt5/172"},{"id":"sv9-1","name":"Caterpie","set":"Journey Together","date":"2025-03-28","rarity":"Common","number":"1","artist":null,"img":"sv9/1"},{"id":"sv3pt5-10","name":"Caterpie","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Common","number":"10","artist":"Tika Matsuno","img":"sv3pt5/10"},{"id":"swsh8-1","name":"Caterpie","set":"Fusion Strike","date":"2021-11-12","rarity":"Common","number":"1","artist":"Mitsuhiro Arita","img":"swsh8/1"},{"id":"swsh2-1","name":"Caterpie","set":"Rebel Clash","date":"2020-05-01","rarity":"Common","number":"1","artist":"Uta","img":"swsh2/1"},{"id":"mcd19-1","name":"Caterpie","set":"McDonald's Collection 2019","date":"2019-10-15","rarity":null,"number":"1","artist":"Sekio","img":"mcd19/1"},{"id":"sm115-1","name":"Caterpie","set":"Hidden Fates","date":"2019-08-23","rarity":"Common","number":"1","artist":"tetsuya koizumi","img":"sm115/1"},{"id":"sm10-2","name":"Caterpie","set":"Unbroken Bonds","date":"2019-05-03","rarity":"Common","number":"